        "prompt": "Create a polished widescreen 16:9 key-art illustration for CIVICA, an investigative visual novel set during an election in a fictional Latin American city. The attached images are STYLE AND CHARACTER REFERENCES, not edit targets: preserve the recognizable faces and outfits of the young brown-haired citizen in a black hoodie holding a phone and the brown-haired woman journalist with beige blazer, dark clothes, press lanyard and notebook. A tense, intimate newsroom at blue hour overlooking a warm illuminated Colombian city square with clocktower. Composition: characters grouped in the RIGHT HALF, citizen slightly in foreground looking at a phone, journalist beside him studying a marked document, human curiosity rather than action combat. LEFT HALF must have quiet deep petrol/indigo negative space with faint rainy glass and distant city lights, suitable for large live UI typography. On desk near lower right a smartphone, archival document, headphones and evidence photographs, subtle coral screen glow. Painterly cinematic anime realism matching reference faces, rich warm amber highlights against teal shadows, restrained atmospheric depth, elegant illustrated mystery-game art, crisp details, coherent hands. No words, no letters, no numbers, no logos, no watermarks, no fake UI baked in. Render an actual background asset, not a framed mockup, landscape composition.",
