        "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: illustrated city map background for a playable investigative visual novel. Create a high-quality wide 16:9 bird's-eye / gentle isometric map of Ciudad Nova, a fictional Colombian city, with exactly three clear landmark areas: municipal archive in an elegant cream building at upper LEFT, a leafy residential neighborhood with school and cafe at lower CENTER, a newsroom with broad lit windows at upper RIGHT. A warm illuminated civic plaza with clocktower in distant upper center ties the city together, matching the cinematic painterly atmosphere and architecture of the reference. Curved walkable streets and river or green corridor connect the three areas. Rich petrol blue dusk and amber windows, hand-painted detailed roofs and tropical trees, inviting small-scale city, sophisticated illustrated game art, restrained rather than cartoon toy village. All three interactive landmark locations must be visibly different with clear open patches nearby for live labels and clickable markers drawn by the application. Crisp composition legible at 900 pixels width. No text, letters, numbers, labels, icons, UI, borders, map legend, compass or watermarks. Render a complete usable scenic map illustration, not a screenshot or interface mockup.",
