        "prompt": "Create a widescreen 16:9 illustrated background plate for a serious but inviting investigative visual novel, matching the warm painterly cinematic mystery style of the attached city reference. Overhead three-quarter view of a newsroom investigation desk at night, elegant warm wood, pool of amber light from brass desk lamp, dark petrol blue shadows, subtle rain reflected in window top edge. An open archival folder with two blank off-white document sheets in the CENTER, an unbranded black smartphone and headphones on the RIGHT, three photographic prints near LOWER LEFT, a folded neighborhood street map at UPPER LEFT, a fountain pen and small coral paper tab. Distinct physical materials, high quality illustration, believable perspective, uncluttered enough for live UI overlays. Critical: all papers and phone display blank, no text, no lettering, no numbers or fake news headlines, no badges, no watermarks. No people or hands. Colors and visual atmosphere should match the reference's sophisticated Colombian city at blue hour. Full-frame usable illustration, not a product mockup or rendered app screenshot.",
